        <mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5A6375&quot;&gt;Queries are side-effect free and run against the window’s store (DuckDB, in the store worker). Grid, timeline and charts are independent effects whose stale replies are dropped; the query panel streams progress and can be cancelled.&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="82" width="1100" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
