        <mxCell id="c200" value="Every query command runs off the UI thread (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;spawn_blocking&lt;/span&gt;) against the window’s store; an import never blocks readers. &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;query_page&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;query_timeline&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;query_chart&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;source_context&lt;/span&gt; are not cancelled; the UI ignores stale replies (seq / generation). &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;run_query_stream&lt;/span&gt; keys jobs by (window, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;queryId&lt;/span&gt;), at most 8 per window; the job is removed when it ends." style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;shape=note;size=12;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#8A93A6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2130;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="3074" width="940" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
